{"3602150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rise Of Transport", "steam_appid": 3602150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers an open-world vehicle simulation experience. <br>The game is played from a first-person/third-person perspective of your custom avatar. <br>You can freely ride and dismount your vehicles at will, providing a more immersive vehicle simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both land and sea vehicles from the early ages of transportation. You can explore the world at your leisure, or engage in commerce by accepting transport jobs. <br>From early horse-drawn carts to massive sail ships, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a realistic yet simplistic approach to vehicle simulation, <strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers relaxed gameplay while you enjoy beautiful graphics in a highly optimized environment. <br>Manage your sails and crew, as well as your horses and carts. Play the way you want — whether you're focusing on exploration, trade, or both. <br>Buy and trade vehicles and properties, expand your fleet, and discover new places. You can also play with friends in cooperative multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include additional downloadable content (DLC) in the future, featuring new eras like the <strong>Industrial Era</strong> and <strong>Modern Era</strong>, with more vehicles and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: <strong>This is an Early Access version and not a fully finished game.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers an open-world vehicle simulation experience. <br>The game is played from a first-person/third-person perspective of your custom avatar. <br>You can freely ride and dismount your vehicles at will, providing a more immersive vehicle simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both land and sea vehicles from the early ages of transportation. You can explore the world at your leisure, or engage in commerce by accepting transport jobs. <br>From early horse-drawn carts to massive sail ships, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a realistic yet simplistic approach to vehicle simulation, <strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers relaxed gameplay while you enjoy beautiful graphics in a highly optimized environment. <br>Manage your sails and crew, as well as your horses and carts. Play the way you want — whether you're focusing on exploration, trade, or both. <br>Buy and trade vehicles and properties, expand your fleet, and discover new places. You can also play with friends in cooperative multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include additional downloadable content (DLC) in the future, featuring new eras like the <strong>Industrial Era</strong> and <strong>Modern Era</strong>, with more vehicles and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: <strong>This is an Early Access version and not a fully finished game.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Enjoy the trill of vehicle simulation in this open-world transport RPG game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602150/5408a29d6c1d137decc592cdb0f5dc74eeb9c745/header.jpg?t=1758238804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602150/6bf59ca687042c3792f050c86a4bd24f89b61611/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758238804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602150/6bf59ca687042c3792f050c86a4bd24f89b61611/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758238804", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Proce